    "stars": "Allied with the Moon.",
    "fairies": "Generally evil; never associate with Moon.",
    "devils": "Mostly lunar. A minority became power-mad after the Moon's death.",
    "castle": "Black Diabolical castle with a red moon symbol is a lunar ally.",
    "benedict": "Solar heroine exception and former ally of Moon. Only a cracked marble-and-gold protective statue remains, looking toward lower Lost Town.",
    "underground": "Closed continuous rock ceilings; no sky, sun, moon, clouds or surface openings.",
    "obser": "Cracked grey stone disc with engraved central almond eye; not generic decoration.",
    "elementalForest": "Fire trees, living green trees, frozen trees, crystals, earth and streams share a coherent forest."
  },
  "assets": [
    {
      "id": "hidenas",
      "name": "Hidenas",
      "motif": "HIDENAS: an original dark fantasy village/city of crooked towers shaped like GRAY CHARRED TREE TRUNKS, twisted branched roofs and long gnarled wall forms. INTENSE FIRE shines from the windows. In the CENTRAL village square an ENORMOUS BONFIRE rises, with human villagers kneeling or standing in PRAYER around it; people are worshipping the fire, not being burned. A narrow foreground lane opens into this square, crooked houses frame the scene, ash falls gently. Strong ashen gray and living orange flame; no coastline or generic castle. Use the second reference solely as loose twisted architecture inspiration, redesign it as burnt tree buildings, no copied watermark or text.",
      "file": "assets/oculum/theme_stories/webp/hidenas.webp"
    },
